    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build whatever you want in Sunny Shores. Combine the <i>aesthetics</i> of 3D lofi and the creative freedom of\u00a0a block-based infinite open sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hunt, forage, farm and fish to survive the different seasons. Losing is fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play single-player or multiplayer with your friends by hosting a dedicated server. Oh, and watch out for that arr-WATCH OU-AAAAAAA!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/6d6d77e4c85ed80eb4df45f081c7f6a8.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build whatever you want in Sunny Shores. Combine the <i>aesthetics</i> of 3D lofi and the creative freedom of\u00a0a block-based infinite open sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/426f55bb461741448d3a50c20713ba7c.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hunt, forage, farm and fish to survive the different seasons. Losing is fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.poster.avif?t=1755577754\" width=672 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.webm?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/9685aacbba4119e77560cfc8b97f4cd1.mp4?t=1755577754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play single-player or multiplayer with your friends by hosting a dedicated server. Oh, and watch out for that arr-WATCH OU-AAAAAAA!</p>",
